# Two images build from this root. The studio image copies `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock`; the
# sim image (docker/Dockerfile) those two plus `README.md` and `src/`. Everything else is context
# sent to the daemon for nothing: `.venv` alone is gigabytes, `banks/` grows without limit, and
# `docker/openpilot/deps` is the 309 MB openpilot fork that belongs to the *bridge* image's own
# context (docker/openpilot/), not this one.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
src/**/__pycache__
